# Enforce LF everywhere: silences "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings
# on Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true. Binary detection stays automatic.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Web UI assets are asserted byte-wise by Go tests (which look for \n) and
# must stay LF in the worktree regardless of core.autocrlf.
pkg/cmd/analyzer/web/** text eol=lf
pkg/api/web/** text eol=lf
